    <div id='content' class='animate flex flex-col gap-y-10 md:w-4/5 lg:w-5/6'>
      <Section title='About'>
        <p class='text-muted-foreground'>LLM / NLP / Machine Learning / Quantitative Finance</p>
        <p class='text-muted-foreground'>
          Hello and welcome to my personal website! I am currently a Master's student in Mathematics at Tongji University.
          I hold a Bachelor of Engineering in Computer Science and a Bachelor of Arts in Translation from the University of Electronic Science and Technology of China.
        <p>
          I am currently collaborating closely with Prof. Bo Dai from HKU MMLab and Dr. Xinyu Pan from CUHK MMLab on a project that uses reinforcement learning to train a small model to incrementally build and modify a memory structure based on a novel non-flat intelligent agent memory architecture (MemBrain) in dynamic scenarios such as multi-turn dialogues.
        <p>
          Prior to this, I worked under the supervision of Prof. Zirui Liu and Dr. Wenya Xie at the University of Minnesota, Twin Cities, on a project that involved building memory query effectiveness and downstream tasks (e.g., question answering) based on various agent memory systems.
        <p>
          During my master's studies, I worked under the supervision of Prof. Xiping Zhang on optimizing the properties of DFT algorithms, developing practical optimization algorithms that could be readily deployed in industrial settings.
        <p>
          In Fall 2027 I plan to apply for PhD programs in Computer Science, focusing on LLMs, Agents, and GenAI.
        </p>
        <!-- <Button title='More about me' class='w-fit self-end' href='/about' variant='ahead' /> -->

      <!-- 父容器占满宽度，文字居中 -->
      <div class="w-full text-center">
        <p class="mt-12 text-muted-foreground italic" style="font-family: 'SimSun', '宋体', 'Songti SC', serif;">
          “人的成功是过往一切运气的总和”
        </p>
      </div>
      </Section>
